  "source_note": "<!-- zh -->\n漫画分镜。排版：交叉剪辑，A事件与B事件交替出现，通过快速切换制造紧张或误会。让该分镜机制决定页面结构、阅读顺序、主次画格和镜头节奏；输出一张完整单页漫画页面，画格共同讲述连续情节，角色外观在各格保持一致。\n\n<!-- en -->\nComic storyboard. Layout: Cross-Cutting Parallel Action, rapid alternating sequence between events A and B, amplifying suspense or misunderstanding. Let this storyboard mechanism determine the page structure, reading flow, panel hierarchy, and pacing; output a complete single-page comic where panels tell a continuous story with consistent characters.\n",
